        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 24 at 12:47PM AKDT until September 24 at 7:00PM AKDT by NWS Juneau AK</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...East winds 15 to 25 kt and seas 6 to 9 ft.

* WHERE...Cape Spencer to Cape Fairweather from 15 to 85 NM.

* WHEN...Until 7 PM AKDT this evening.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
